(7316466, 1141318, 30490, '<td valign="top">I really like this image a lot! It is perfectly suited to the challenge topic and very creative.  I''m not sure how you added another hour to the clock so seamlessly, but it works and the eye at the center of the image is just creepy!  I gave this a 10 which is a rarety for my votes.  I hope it will do well with the other voters too!</td>', 'I really like this image a lot! It is perfectly suited to the challenge topic and very creative.  I''m not sure how you added another hour to the clock so seamlessly, but it works and the eye at the center of the image is just creepy!  I gave this a 10 which is a rarety for my votes.  I hope it will do well with the other voters too!', '2015-02-12 14:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316467, 1140732, 30490, '<td valign="top">stunning image of a rose w/ dew.  Love the colors and the lighting.  The background suits this challenge.  A great effort overall and a 9 vote from me!</td>', 'stunning image of a rose w/ dew.  Love the colors and the lighting.  The background suits this challenge.  A great effort overall and a 9 vote from me!', '2015-02-12 14:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316468, 1141344, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great image, suits the challenge and the book line that you chose.  The skin tone on the boy is wonderful, and the lighting is excellent too.  You got a 9 from me!</td>', 'Great image, suits the challenge and the book line that you chose.  The skin tone on the boy is wonderful, and the lighting is excellent too.  You got a 9 from me!', '2015-02-12 14:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316470, 1141246, 30490, '<td valign="top">This truely gives the impression that the novel was written at this desk.  A wonderful pairing of objects so suited for this challenge and the book that you chose.  I really like this image and hope it does well overall. A 9 from me!</td>', 'This truely gives the impression that the novel was written at this desk.  A wonderful pairing of objects so suited for this challenge and the book that you chose.  I really like this image and hope it does well overall. A 9 from me!', '2015-02-12 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316474, 1141338, 30490, '<td valign="top">Intriguing enough for me to Google the first line, and check out the book on Amazon, and add it to my wish list too!  Very interesting capture, and I suspect will dovetail neatly with the plot of the book.</td>', 'Intriguing enough for me to Google the first line, and check out the book on Amazon, and add it to my wish list too!  Very interesting capture, and I suspect will dovetail neatly with the plot of the book.', '2015-02-12 14:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316475, 1141326, 30490, '<td valign="top">I like this image, the colors and the detail. The snow hanging on to the branches.  It fits the opening line of the book too.  Not sure it suits the overall plot of the book which was used to form Caberet, but hey the challenge wasn''t take a photo of a plot, but take a photo of the first line and you did that really well!</td>', 'I like this image, the colors and the detail. The snow hanging on to the branches.  It fits the opening line of the book too.  Not sure it suits the overall plot of the book which was used to form Caberet, but hey the challenge wasn''t take a photo of a plot, but take a photo of the first line and you did that really well!', '2015-02-12 14:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316476, 1141347, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love this concept, good choice for the challenge.  I wish the main element in the foreground was either in focus or less bright as I find it distracting from the real subject of the image the gears.  The gritty detail of the gear is wonderful.</td>', 'Love this concept, good choice for the challenge.  I wish the main element in the foreground was either in focus or less bright as I find it distracting from the real subject of the image the gears.  The gritty detail of the gear is wonderful.', '2015-02-12 14:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316485, 1141344, 159196, '<td valign="top">This is what it''s all about - good enough to go to print!!! Congrats and good luck!</td>', 'This is what it''s all about - good enough to go to print!!! Congrats and good luck!', '2015-02-12 14:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
